# Sunchaser local secrets. Copy to .env (gitignored). In production this
# becomes /etc/sunchaser.env (mode 600) loaded by systemd EnvironmentFile.

# Dedicated, spend-capped Anthropic key for the verdict layer. Create a fresh
# key for this project (don't reuse lotcheck-pro's) so spend is attributable.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
